# ========================
# Uploads / User content
# ========================
# Never commit user media. uploads/operators/ holds operator KYC documents
# (ID proofs, bank papers), so an accidental "git add -A" would publish
# personal data into the repository. Media lives on disk and in S3, never here.
uploads/

temp/
tmp/

